flowchart TD
    B[Browser caller] --> S[Spring Security]
    S --> C[Financial HTTP adapter]
    C --> A[Financial application service]
    W[Authenticated replay-safe webhook] --> A

    A --> Q{Operation-specific scoped lookup}
    Q -->|Participant| PI[Intent by payer or payee]
    Q -->|Payment actor| PA[Intent or attempt by payer]
    Q -->|Provider callback| PP[Attempt by ID and provider]

    PI --> D{Within scope?}
    PA --> D
    PP --> D

    D -->|No| N[Uniform entity-specific 404]
    D -->|Yes| R[Evaluate state, expiry, method and provider]
    R --> T[Conditional transactional transition]
    R --> E[Typed financial exception]
    E --> H[Shared RFC 9457 adapter]
    H --> P[Allowlisted Problem Details]
